      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Custom Widgets__TRILIUM_PH_1__, where JSX can be used to replace the old, jQuery-based mechanism.",
      "sourceHash": "9cf7e60508d05c3cffbe18956213feaf1e688c6e566b0c088feef61fbddad6ba",
