      "id": "u_6c33f04fe7bd9c4bb4b839d2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When using Preact with JSX, there is a special syntax which provides ES-like imports. This __TRILIUM_PH_0__ syntax makes way for a more intuitive that doesn't make use of global objects and paves the way for better auto-completion support that might be introduced in the future. ",
      "sourceHash": "6c33f04fe7bd9c4bb4b839d213df8dc50fc5e05aa19316c3bb7e4e6d84f446db",
      "context": "Preact > Import/exports",
