    {
      "id": "u_9c3b7cb837595e58f7e972f5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There's a new __TRILIUM_PH_0__Script API__TRILIUM_PH_1__ dedicated to Preact, which provides shared components that are also used by Trilium internally as well as hooks, for example.",
