    {
      "id": "u_1688ca4a9185ce7fe592cfeb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "These imports are syntactic sugar meant to replace the usage for the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ global object (see __TRILIUM_PH_1__Script API__TRILIUM_PH_2__). ",
      "sourceHash": "1688ca4a9185ce7fe592cfeb62317abc8889f9141ce0db0e36bc62f4c0e29692",
      "context": "Preact > Import/exports > Import/export are not required",
      "contextHash": "51e713556220749298f66a36bffadf5f4a109c4202f4f0ccad75e3858e4be1ae",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_16bc8e656d1a26a7cbe84279_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and __TRILIUM_PH_1__ syntax work only for JSX notes. Standard/jQuery code notes still need to use the __TRILIUM_PH_2__ global and __TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "16bc8e656d1a26a7cbe84279333304ca6ce31d74034aa9bc84e602d9d547bc74",
      "context": "Preact > Import/exports > Import/export are not required",
