    {
      "id": "u_a5f43d6e6668857da087a61e_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Unlike JavaScript, JSX requires pre-processing to turn it into JavaScript (just like TypeScript). To do so, Trilium uses __TRILIUM_PH_0__Sucrase__TRILIUM_PH_1__, a JavaScript library which processes the JSX to pure JavaScript. The processing is done each time a script is run (for widgets this happens at every program startup). If you notice any performance degradation due to long compilation, consider __TRILIUM_PH_2__reporting the issue__TRILIUM_PH_3__ to us.",
      "sourceHash": "a5f43d6e6668857da087a61e8928f0b51d62975fe1b7a19477e34a5d9d181b8d",
      "context": "Preact > Under the hood",
      "contextHash": "e64fa7d5c4ff1979bf805b055538505542c6d75aabb970598f2005ca66da0780",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
